-- 13  Pea and Cauliflower Curry
--     https://sheerluxe.com/recipes/pea-and-cauliflower-curry
UPDATE `recipe` SET `method` = '1. Crush the green chillies and ginger with a pinch of salt using a pestle and mortar or blender, until they form a fine masala paste.
2. Heat the oil in a large, thick-based frying pan over a medium heat for 30 seconds, then add the cumin seeds and mustard seeds.
